{
  "name": "Support System - Main Agent",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## INPUT & VALIDATION\\n\\nWebhook accepts POST `{ customer_id, conversation_id, message }`. `Validate Input` normalizes fields and generates a `conversation_id` if missing. Invalid payloads are logged and answered with a safe 400 JSON without running the agent.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 380
      },
      "id": "e19b1603-b86f-414c-98bf-07653e47f929",
      "name": "Sticky Note 88a68731",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1856,
        672
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AI AGENT, MEMORY, RAG & TOOLS\\n\\nGemini agent uses Postgres chat memory, the `knowledge_base` RAG tool (pgvector table `knowledge_chunks`), and five customer/order tools. It must use tools for customer-specific data and ground policy answers in retrieved docs. Structured output = { intent, response, escalate, escalation_reason }.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "238e2555-023c-4883-b298-bac8eae4085e",
      "name": "Sticky Note 011e27fd",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1856,
        672
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## RESPONSE VALIDATION & SECURITY\\n\\nSanitizes the agent output, strips leaked secrets/prompt markers, and substitutes a safe fallback (escalate=true) when the output is empty or the agent errored. Prevents hallucinated info by relying on the tool-first system prompt.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 400
      },
      "id": "6cf921e7-35be-4486-a186-9f114c254d48",
      "name": "Sticky Note 757e6426",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1856,
        672
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ESCALATION\\n\\nWhen escalate=true: create a support ticket, email the support team, and tell the customer their request was forwarded to a human. Non-escalation skips ticket + email.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 380
      },
      "id": "d70fafb6-6bd1-42bb-a5e7-5429ae196218",
      "name": "Sticky Note 586b6de3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1856,
        672
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## LOGGING & OUTPUT\\n\\nStores the assistant message, writes a structured row to `support_logs`, and returns exactly `{ conversation_id, intent, response, escalated, ticket_id }`.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 380
      },
      "id": "d43e64e9-7255-41fc-bcaa-6892029a3b01",
      "name": "Sticky Note c41e9fe6",
